                <pb facs="0726" n="700" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v11/pg700"/>


                <head>FINANCIAL APPENDIX</head>
                <p>Cost estimates in the Financial Appendix indicate order of magnitude.</p>
                <p>Approval of the policy statement does not indicate approval of cost estimates in
                    the Financial Appendix.</p>
                <p>Appropriations and expenditures to finance the policy will be subject to
                    determination in the regular budgetary process.</p>
                <pb facs="0727" n="701" xml:id="pg701"/>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Special Note</hi></p>
                <p>All estimates are subject to the assumptions, footnotes, and summary explanation
                    shown below in this Financial Appendix.</p>
